#: lib/flirtual/user/email.ex:375
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgctxt "deletion_reminder_670.body_html"
msgid ""
"<p>It's been a while since you last logged in. There have been many updates "
"to Flirtual over the last couple years such as improvements to our "
"matchmaking system and Homie Mode (making friends). We think you'd enjoy "
"reconnecting with our community!</p><p>Logging in anytime in the next 60 "
"days will keep your account active and save all your profile information.</p>"
"<p>If we don't see you log in within 60 days, we'll need to delete your "
"account and data in accordance with our privacy policy. But we're hoping "
"you'll come back and give Flirtual another try!</p><p><a href=\"%{action_url}"
"\" class=\"btn\">Log in</a></p>"
msgstr ""

#: lib/flirtual/user/email.ex:374
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgctxt "deletion_reminder_670.body_text"
msgid ""
"It's been a while since you last logged in. There have been many updates to "
"Flirtual over the last couple years such as improvements to our matchmaking "
"system and Homie Mode (making friends). We think you'd enjoy reconnecting "
"with our community!\n"
"\n"
"Logging in anytime in the next 60 days will keep your account active and "
"save all your profile information.\n"
"\n"
"If we don't see you log in within 60 days, we'll need to delete your account "
"and data in accordance with our privacy policy. But we're hoping you'll come "
"back and give Flirtual another try!\n"
"\n"
"Log in anytime to keep your account: %{action_url}"
msgstr ""

